Manage credit card icons on checkout form in WooCommerce stripe payment gateway.

== Description ==

Manage credit card icons on checkout form in WooCommerce stripe payment gateway.

WooCommerceのStripe決済画面を拡張し、表示するクレジットカードのアイコンを変更できます。

KEY FEATURES
* Manage to display credit card icons in checkout form.

PREMIUM FEATURES:
* Manage JCB icon.

他にも[使いやすいWordpressプラグイン](https://shop.elvez.co.jp/product-category/wordpress%e3%83%97%e3%83%a9%e3%82%b0%e3%82%a4%e3%83%b3/)をご用意しています。
We provide other [useful Wordpress plugins](https://shop.elvez.co.jp/product-category/wordpress%e3%83%97%e3%83%a9%e3%82%b0%e3%82%a4%e3%83%b3/).

== Installation ==

1. Upload the plugin files to the `/wp-content/plugins/elvez-wc-stripe-card-icon` directory, or install the plugin through the WordPress plugins screen directly.
2. Activate the plugin through the 'Plugins' screen in WordPress
3. Use the Dashboard->Elvez Hide Entry Header to configure the plugin


